{
  "name": "@kandarlubis/icil",
  "version": "27.1.0",
  "description": "ICIL — Intelligence Campus Interactive Library. 243 courses, 32 faculties, 10 MCP tools. Anti-Slop faculty for AI output quality. Indonesian keyword layer + direct-match-first course ranking. P@3 86.2% across 251 routing prompts; 20/20 off-topic prompts blocked.",
